      "settings": {
        "heading": "Pakistan’s Trusted Organic Skincare Brand – Shivora Naturals",
        "text": "<p>At Shivora Naturals, we’re proud to be recognized as one of Pakistan’s most trusted organic skincare brands. Our mission is to create safe, chemical-free, and dermatologist-approved products that actually work especially for Pakistani skin. Whether you’re dealing with dry skin during Islamabad’s cold winters or oily breakouts in Karachi’s humidity, our formulas are made to adapt to your local environment. Every product is crafted with powerful natural ingredients like snail mucin, aloe vera, and niacinamide, all chosen for their proven benefits. Made in Pakistan with GMP-certified processes and cruelty-free ethics, Shivora Naturals is more than skincare – it’s a commitment to healthy, radiant, and naturally glowing skin. Trusted by thousands of men and women across the country, Shivora is your go-to for clean, honest, and effective beauty.</p>",
        "button_label": "Shop Now",
        "button_link": "/collections/all"
      }
